WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:07.818
Cora grabbed her friends.

2
00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:10.204
Then she grabbed onto a rock.

3
00:00:10.205 --> 00:00:12.540
Water rushed past them.

4
00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:16.440
Soon it slowed down.

5
00:00:16.441 --> 00:00:23.793
"Back to the egg case!" Cora yelled.

6
00:00:23.794 --> 00:00:28.916
The friends swam back.

7
00:00:28.917 --> 00:00:33.519
Mo looked up and groaned.

8
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.196
"How will we reach it?"

9
00:00:36.197 --> 00:00:43.210
"My poor babies!" Sally said.

10
00:00:43.211 --> 00:00:47.915
"Stay here." Cora grabbed a rock.

11
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:51.609
"Grr!" She pulled herself up . . .

12
00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.336
Cora was out of the water!

13
00:00:54.337 --> 00:00:56.553
Cora climbed higher.

14
00:00:56.554 --> 00:01:00.785
Gently, she picked up the egg case.

15
00:01:00.786 --> 00:01:03.167
She wrapped an arm around it.

16
00:01:03.168 --> 00:01:09.149
Then she dropped back down. Splash!

17
00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:15.779
Sally hugged Cora. "You saved my babies!"

18
00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.549
Cora smiled. "I love to help—"

19
00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:22.229
Rumble. Rumble.

20
00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:28.082
Cora gulped. "Is that another wave?"

21
00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:45.282
"Yikes! Everyone, swim!" Mo said. "Fast!"

22
00:01:45.283 --> 00:01:49.303
The three friends shot out of the cave.

23
00:01:49.304 --> 00:01:53.552
"Whew!" Cora said. "We beat the wave.

24
00:01:53.553 --> 00:02:00.506
Let's get out of here!"

25
00:02:00.506 --> 00:02:06.063
Cora and Mo were drawing again.

26
00:02:06.064 --> 00:02:09.185
"I like your star drawing," Mo said.

27
00:02:09.186 --> 00:02:12.765
Cora groaned.

28
00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:16.680
"It's supposed to be an octopus."

29
00:02:16.681 --> 00:02:21.447
Mo laughed. "Oh well.

30
00:02:21.448 --> 00:02:24.319
You're not the best artist at the reef.

31
00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:25.516
But you're—"

32
00:02:25.517 --> 00:02:30.898
Cora grinned. "The best helper!"

